          "legendFormat": "max"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "KEDA — Content Trigger Signals",
      "description": "Signals behind the content ScaledObject. The consumer_name regex covers both the batch durable and the interactive one used by See Content, which has its own interactive-wakeup trigger. Server-side signal from the NATS exporter (no namespace/pod labels).",
